{"nodes": [{"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing", "label": "Testing", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_unit_tests", "label": "Unit Tests", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Unit testing", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unit tests are the fastest layer: native Rust with soroban-sdk testutils, not WASM, so the debugger works. They live in src/test.rs behind #![cfg(test)]. env.register passes constructor args, and register_at pins an address."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_resource_limits", "label": "Test Resource Limits", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Unit testing", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Since SDK 25, Env::default() applies mainnet CPU and memory limits, so a contract that would blow the budget in production fails in unit tests. Disable limits only for deliberately heavy tests, and read consumption from env.cost_estimate().resources()."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_authorization", "label": "Authorization Testing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Authorization", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "mock_all_auths approves everything and can hide a missing require_auth. Pair it with env.auths() assertions or mock one invocation. Assert the exact tree, including sub-invocations, on security-critical paths. If the contract authorizes calls below the entry point, use mock_all_auths_allowing_non_root_auth."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_mock_all_auths", "label": "mock_all_auths", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Authorization", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "mock_all_auths approves every authorization and can hide a missing require_auth."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_mock_auths", "label": "mock_auths", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Authorization", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "mock_auths approves only the listed invocation: address, contract, function name, arguments, and sub-invokes."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_env_auths", "label": "env.auths", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Authorization", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "env.auths() returns (Address, AuthorizedInvocation) pairs for the most recent invocation only. Any later client call, even a read, resets it, so the assertion must run immediately."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_events", "label": "Event Assertions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Events", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "#[contractevent] values compare directly with emitted XDR via event.to_xdr. env.events().all() returns only the most recent invocation and resets on the next call."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_storage_ttl", "label": "Storage TTL Tests", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Storage TTL", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "get_ttl lives on soroban_sdk testutils storage traits. Read it from inside env.as_contract so the test sees that contract's storage."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_cross_contract", "label": "Cross-contract Tests", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Cross-contract", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Register a real dependency from its WASM with contractimport and drive both contracts through typed clients."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_fuzz", "label": "Fuzz Testing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Fuzz testing", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "cargo-fuzz works because every #[contracttype] implements SorobanArbitrary under the testutils feature. Fuzz value-moving paths and call try_ methods so unexpected panics fail the harness. The lib plus cdylib crate types already expose the target fuzzing needs."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_sorobanarbitrary", "label": "SorobanArbitrary", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Fuzz testing", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Under the testutils feature, every #[contracttype] implements SorobanArbitrary, so cargo-fuzz and proptest can generate contract values without a custom strategy."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_proptest", "label": "Property-based Testing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Property-based testing", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "proptest plus SorobanArbitrary runs in plain cargo test. Fuzz interactively to find deep bugs, then convert the findings into proptest regressions for CI."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_snapshots", "label": "Test Snapshots", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Snapshots, fork tests, mutation tests", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every test writes a JSON snapshot of events and final ledger state to test_snapshots/. Commit them so diffs expose unintended behavior. Disable per environment with Env::new_with_config when they are noise."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_fork_tests", "label": "Fork Tests", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Snapshots, fork tests, mutation tests", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "stellar snapshot create captures real ledger state, and Env::from_ledger_snapshot_file replays tests against it. The same path rehearses upgrades: fetch the deployed WASM, register the old and new versions, and compare behavior."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_mutation", "label": "Mutation Testing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Snapshots, fork tests, mutation tests", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "cargo-mutants mutates the source and reports MISSED where the tests did not notice."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_testnet", "label": "Testnet", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Testnet", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Testnet resets quarterly and deletes everything, so deployments must be scripted and testnet state is not durable. Testnet runs the next protocol version before mainnet, which is where an upcoming upgrade is verified."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_stellar_sdk", "label": "@stellar/stellar-sdk", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Integration tests", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "TypeScript integration tests use the same flow as a frontend: simulate, assemble, sign, and send against local or testnet. In Rust, gate network tests with #[ignore] and run them only when the network is up."}, {"id": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_ledger", "label": "Ledger Test State", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Time and ledger state", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "env.ledger().set_timestamp and set_sequence_number advance ledger time so vesting and timelock logic can be tested without waiting for ledgers."}], "edges": [{"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_skill", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Testing", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_development", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Testing", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_security", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Testing", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_unit_tests", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_skill_testutils", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Unit testing", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_resource_limits", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_unit_tests", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Unit testing", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_resource_limits", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_development_fees", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Unit testing", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_authorization", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_mock_all_auths", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Authorization", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_authorization", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_mock_auths", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Authorization", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_authorization", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_env_auths", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Authorization", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_mock_all_auths", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_development_require_auth", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Authorization", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_mock_all_auths", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_security_missing_authorization", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Authorization", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_authorization", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_development_authorize_as_current_contract", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Authorization", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_events", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_development_contractevent", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Events", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_storage_ttl", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_development_persistent_storage", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Storage TTL", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_storage_ttl", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_development_ttl", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Storage TTL", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_cross_contract", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_development_contractimport", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Cross-contract", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_cross_contract", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_unit_tests", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Cross-contract", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_fuzz", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_sorobanarbitrary", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Fuzz testing", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_fuzz", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_skill_testutils", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Fuzz testing", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_proptest", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_sorobanarbitrary", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Property-based testing", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_proptest", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_fuzz", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Property-based testing", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_snapshots", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_events", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Snapshots, fork tests, mutation tests", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_fork_tests", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_development_upgrades", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Snapshots, fork tests, mutation tests", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_mutation", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_unit_tests", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Snapshots, fork tests, mutation tests", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_stellar_sdk", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_testnet", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Integration tests", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_testing_ledger", "target": "agents_skills_smart_contracts_development_governance", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": ".agents/skills/smart-contracts/testing.md", "source_location": "Time and ledger state", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}